{"id": "t049-034", "text": "Emil's daughter has her grade 5 piano exam on the 12th at half 9. Remind me to ask him how she did that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 5 piano exam", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how she did", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t049-035", "text": "Kalani says Olivia is moving to Bristol in the new year for her husband's job. She's not thrilled about leaving everyone behind.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t049-036", "text": "Went to Gustavo's 50th last night. Great evening. Francesca was there with her new partner, Kwame Haddad, who teaches at the same school as Gustavo.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "50th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame Haddad", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "teaches at the same school", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t049-037", "text": "Naledi's son Owen has his first football match for the under-nines on Saturday morning. Kick-off is at 9:30.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first football match for the under-nines", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9:30", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t049-038", "text": "Ioana's book club dinner is postponed indefinitely because her landlord is doing work on the kitchen. Barbara is hosting a smaller get-together at hers instead, on Thursday at 7. We're reading the new Sally Rooney, and I haven't started it yet. Barbara is gluten free, so whatever I bake needs to be too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "get-together", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gluten free", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t049-039", "text": "Don't forget: Wei's daughter graduates from nursery on Friday at 2. Wei wants a few of us there for the little ceremony, and there's cake afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t049-040", "text": "Milan's dog Pepper has gone missing. He's been out looking since this morning and is beside himself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gone missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "beside himself", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t049-041", "text": "Need to ring Lachlan on Sunday about the dinner plans for his mum's 70th.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Lachlan", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
{"id": "t049-042", "text": "Svetlana told me her son Jakub got a first in his engineering degree. The graduation is in July.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first in his engineering degree", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in July", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t049-043", "text": "Garden centre on Saturday morning, then the tip. Nothing else planned for the weekend, thank goodness.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Garden centre", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "the tip", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend"}]}
{"id": "t049-044", "text": "Gareth and Abigail's anniversary dinner on Saturday has been cancelled. Their babysitter fell through, so they're doing a takeaway at home instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "babysitter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "takeaway", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t049-045", "text": "Chidi is sitting his eleven-plus on the 15th. His mum says he's surprisingly calm about it. I should drop off a good luck card the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chidi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eleven-plus", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "surprisingly calm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off a good luck card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t049-046", "text": "Farah's housewarming is next Saturday at 3pm. She's just moved into a two-bed in Chorlton with her girlfriend, Hana Morris.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday at 3pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "two-bed in Chorlton", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hana Morris", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t049-047", "text": "Lunch with Aidan. He's training for the Edinburgh marathon in May, and he's also started volunteering at a food bank on Tuesdays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Edinburgh marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "volunteering at a food bank", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesdays"}]}
{"id": "t049-048", "text": "Remind me to message Jun the week after his son's first day at secondary school to ask how he's settling in.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Jun", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day at secondary school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t049-049", "text": "Ravi's wife Noor is starting her new job as a deputy head on Monday. Ravi says she's nervous but excited. I should text her on Sunday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job as a deputy head", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ravi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t049-050", "text": "Irina said her boss is leaving and she might be up for his role. She has an interview on the 4th at 10am. She seemed fairly relaxed about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fairly relaxed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t049-051", "text": "Aneesh's grandad passed away on Tuesday. The funeral is next Friday at 1pm. Aneesh is flying back to Delhi on Wednesday to be with the family. Remind me to check in with him over the weekend and, if he's back by then, take him for a coffee the week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday at 1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back to Delhi", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "by then", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t049-052", "text": "Mrs Tanaka next door is having a little party for her 80th on Sunday afternoon in the church hall. Her son Kalani is coming up from London for it with his kids, and she asked me to help set up that morning from about 10. Must remember to buy her some lilies on Saturday, since she said roses make her sneeze.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Tanaka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "80th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming up from London", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning from about 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy her some lilies", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "roses make her sneeze", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t049-053", "text": "Note for later: Olivia hates surprises, so no surprise party for her birthday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates surprises", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t049-054", "text": "Spoke to Dr Petrov about Matteo. He's recovering well after the operation and should be home by Thursday, though he'll need physio twice a week for a while. His partner Jakub is working from home to look after him. I'll visit him on Friday afternoon, and maybe take him some of those almond biscuits he likes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Petrov", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "be home", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "need physio twice a week", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "working from home", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday afternoon"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "almond biscuits", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t049-055", "text": "Big dinner at Francesca and Gustavo's on the 19th at 7:30 to celebrate their daughter finishing her PhD. Dress code is smart casual, and Francesca said she'd sort a taxi back for anyone who needs one. I'm sharing a ride with Naledi and Kwame there and then making my own way home later.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gustavo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th at 7:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finishing her PhD", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "later"}]}
{"id": "t049-056", "text": "Kwame's niece Ioana has her ballet recital on Saturday at 4pm and he asked if I'd like to come. I said yes. Remind me to get her some flowers that morning and to text Kwame the next day to say thank you.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "niece", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ballet recital", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at 4pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her some flowers", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Kwame", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t049-057", "text": "Wei says Uncle Milan's sixtieth is on the 28th, a big family lunch in Chinatown. Wei's brother is flying in from Singapore the night before, and it's the first time they'll all be together since the wedding three years ago. Wei is a bit stressed because she's organising the whole thing. I should ask her on the Monday after how it all went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Milan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sixtieth", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Singapore", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "three years ago", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Monday after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t049-058", "text": "Picked up the new running shoes. Need to return the old pair to the shop by the 31st.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "return the old pair to the shop", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 31st", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t049-059", "text": "Lachlan has started learning Portuguese because his partner's family are from Porto. He's going over to meet them for the first time at Christmas, flying out on the 22nd and staying for a week. He's nervous about the language barrier and about her dad, who apparently doesn't say much. He's doing an evening class on Wednesdays and an app on the side.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learning Portuguese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Porto", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over to meet them", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't say much", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}]}
{"id": "t049-060", "text": "Svetlana's daughter Layla is starting her first proper job on Monday at an architecture firm in Leeds. Svetlana is clearly so proud. Remind me to send Layla a quick message that evening to ask how her first day went, and then check in again the week after when she's settled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first proper job", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "architecture firm in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Svetlana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Layla a quick message", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in again", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she's settled", "anchor": "a2"}]}
